# Savv Design System

Source of truth: `src/app/globals.css` (`:root` / `.dark` + `@theme`). Prefer semantic Tailwind tokens over hardcoded palette colors (`blue-600`, `gray-900`, hex, etc.).

## Brand & neutrals

| Token | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `primary` / `primary-hover` / `primary-muted` / `primary-highlight` | Brand #155DFC, hover, subtle fills |
| `background` | Elevated white surfaces / cards |
| `surface` | Page chrome (`body`) |
| `foreground` / `muted-foreground` / `text-muted` | Text hierarchy |
| `border` / `input` / `ring` | Borders and focus |

## Financial semantics

| Token | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| `income` / `success` | Income, positive, success (#16A34A) |
| `expense` / `destructive` | Expenses, errors, destructive (#EF4444) |
| `transfer` | Transfers (#8B5CF6) |
| `warning` | Warnings (#F59E0B) |

Amounts: use `getMovementAmountClass(type)` or `getSignedAmountClass(amount)` from `@/modules/shared/utils/movement-amount-class`.

Charts (Recharts hex): `@/modules/shared/utils/chart-colors` — blue scale from brand; reserve green/red/purple/amber for semantics only.

## Typography

- **Inter** (`font-sans`): default everywhere
- **Space Grotesk** (`font-display`): landing hero + prominent marketing brand headings only

## UI conventions

- Radius ~8–12px (`--radius: 0.625rem`); cards may use `rounded-xl`
- Subtle 1px borders, soft shadows (`shadow-xs` / `shadow-sm`); flat UI — no heavy gradients/glass/glow
- Buttons: `bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover`; focus rings: `ring-ring`
- Skeletons: `bg-muted`; page bg: `bg-surface`; cards: `bg-card`
- shadcn lives in `src/ui` — extend via tokens, don’t invent parallel color systems

## Exceptions (do not “fix” these)

- Category user colors in `constants.ts` / `IconPicker.tsx` (multi-color swatches)
- Dark: keep `.dark` tokens coherent; don’t remove dark variables. No ThemeProvider required unless asked

## ❌ Avoid

```tsx
// BAD
className="bg-blue-600 text-gray-900 text-green-600"
// GOOD
className="bg-primary text-foreground text-income"
```
